{title: How Faithful}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

>Lyrics

(Accordion Introduction)

Verse 1

How faithful I have found the love of the Lord,

New grace and mercy ev'ry day.

He stands beside me in my sorrow or joy,

A constant Help along the way.

(Short Accordion Solo)

Verse 2

The day I gave the Lord my heart and my soul,

He gave me peace beyond compare.

He is the Stronghold of my life, and I know

Now and forever, He is there!

Bridge - Accordion

By His redemption, I am a child of God,

He gave me life that has no end,

And one day soon, I will see Him face to face,

The Brother on whose Word I can depend!

Verse 3

How faithful I have found the love of the Lord,

New grace and mercy ev'ry day.

He leads me onward as I follow the road,

He's here beside me all the way!

(Accordion Ending)
